{"unit_id":"Small-Miao__dsh-statusbar#card-zh","repo":"Small-Miao/dsh-statusbar","commit":"a5a9cd026533dfd57f3b88a6fea11f591a5a1d22","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-statusbar 是面向 DSH Web 的底部状态栏插件，在 shell.overlay 显示会话和主机信息，并在设置页管理显示条目。它汇总当前会话的估算 token、轮数与步骤、模型和工具耗时、首 token 延迟、生成速率及缓存用量，也展示主机 CPU、内存和时钟。用户可以调整条目的可见性、左右位置与顺序；其他宿主插件还能注册文本、进度条或异步数据源。适合希望在网页界面快速查看会话性能与主机状态的 DSH 用户，以及需要共享状态栏扩展接口的插件作者。需要安装在 DSH web profile 中；代码未要求额外密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:365-376","lib/index.js:434-520","lib/client.js:327-334"]}
{"unit_id":"Small-Miao__dsh-statusbar#card-en","repo":"Small-Miao/dsh-statusbar","commit":"a5a9cd026533dfd57f3b88a6fea11f591a5a1d22","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-statusbar adds a bottom bar to DSH Web for session and host status. It shows tokens, session timing, generation speed, cache usage, CPU, memory, and clock. Users can reorder or hide items. Host plugins can add text, progress bars, and data sources. Requires a DSH web profile; no extra keys.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:365-376","lib/index.js:434-520","lib/client.js:327-334"]}
