{"unit_id":"Small-Miao__dsh-statusbar#feature-1","repo":"Small-Miao/dsh-statusbar","commit":"a5a9cd026533dfd57f3b88a6fea11f591a5a1d22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-statusbar 的功能「会话用量展示」：在网页状态栏列出当前会话的估算 token、轮数步骤、累计调用耗时、首 token 与生成速率、缓存命中及输入输出 token。客户端定时获取快照。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:321-353","lib/index.js:434-515","lib/client.js:203-223"]}
{"unit_id":"Small-Miao__dsh-statusbar#feature-2","repo":"Small-Miao/dsh-statusbar","commit":"a5a9cd026533dfd57f3b88a6fea11f591a5a1d22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-statusbar 的功能「主机资源监测」：在底部栏展示宿主机 CPU 与内存占用，并用渐变字符条表示百分比。CPU 和内存由宿主端读取系统指标后更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:288-319","lib/index.js:461-484"]}
